{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_01B7E0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"列车<R=车库,Terminal>附近那些巨大的脚印……你觉得是什么，Kaz？","cn_control_tokens":"<R=车库,Terminal>","cn_utf8_bytes":85,"review_flag":"RUBY_LOCALIZED"},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"不知道……就算是大象也没那么大。让我想起Chico说过的<R=Basilisk,Basilisco>。","cn_control_tokens":"<R=Basilisk,Basilisco>","cn_utf8_bytes":99,"review_flag":"RUBY_LOCALIZED"},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"虽然我不愿相信……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":27,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"我也是。如果他们真有那种兵器……它和<R=Basilisk,Basilisco>相似的，也许不只是外形。","cn_control_tokens":"<R=Basilisk,Basilisco>","cn_utf8_bytes":112,"review_flag":"RUBY_LOCALIZED"},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"什么意思？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":15,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"听说中世纪的百科全书里是这么写的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"「Basilisk是蛇中之王。蛇畏惧Basilisk，一见到它就会逃跑……」","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":82,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"「因为Basilisk会用气味和吐息杀死蛇。」","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":53,"review_flag":"AUX_FOUL_EXPANSION_IGNORED"},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"以蛇制蛇，是吗。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":24,"review_flag":"CONTEXTUAL_IDIOM"},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"不是想吓你……不过再小心也不为过。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"我知道。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":12,"review_flag":""}]}